{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19650","headline":"奉和武中丞秋日台中寄怀简诸僚友 · 吕温","name":"奉和武中丞秋日台中寄怀简诸僚友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝思纪律，宪府得中贤。\n指顾风行地，仪形月丽天。\n不仁恒自远，爲政复何先。\n虚室唯生白，闲情却草玄。\n迎霜红叶早，过雨碧苔鲜。\n鱼乐翻秋水，乌声隔暮烟。\n旧游多绝席，感物遂成篇。\n更许穷荒谷，追歌白雪前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}